    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sales sync - Store C\n**Runs:** Monday 02:00\n\nPulls **completed sales orders** (`idSituacao=9`) from the Bling ERP v3 API for the **last 3 months up to yesterday** and writes one row per order item.\n\nFreight, order discount and other expenses are **prorated per item** by its share of the order total.\n\nRows are **upserted on `ID Item Venda`**, so re-processing a page never duplicates data.",
        "height": 270,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        210
      ],
      "id": "83da18d1-72aa-4570-8683-a0504a5ba668",
      "name": "About"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### OAuth token rotation\n**Runs:** every 4 hours\n\nBling access tokens live 6 hours. This branch refreshes them every 4 hours and stores the pair in a `Tokens` sheet (`id`, `access_token`, `refresh_token`).\n\nClient ID and secret come from a **Basic Auth credential**, never hard-coded.",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -270
      ],
      "id": "d345612b-d8dd-483c-8c1b-eff6cae5d1a2",
      "name": "Token note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
